{"query": "Can I request a deviation from NSF's preparation requirements?", "expected_id": "pappg-24-1#II.A.1", "tag": "deviations"}
{"query": "What accessibility accommodations does NSF provide for proposers?", "expected_id": "pappg-24-1#II.A.2", "tag": "accommodations"}

